Description:
Establish and document the team's Git workflow. The strategy should use a main branch (production-ready only), a dev branch (integration), and feature/* branches for individual stories. Configure branch protection on main so that direct pushes are blocked and at least one PR review is required to merge.

Acceptance criteria

* {color:#ffffff}Branch protection is enabled on main: direct pushes are blocked, 1 PR approval required{color}
* {color:#ffffff}A CONTRIBUTING.md or section in README documents the branch naming convention (e.g. feature/form700-parser){color}
* {color:#ffffff}All 8 team members have successfully cloned the repo and can push a feature branch without errors{color}
* {color:#ffffff}A test PR from dev → main is created and correctly blocked until approved{color}
